> Time: 1440633648 / Thu, 27 Aug 2015 00:00:48 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=77311&start=40&SessionId=c21aef4ecb9e80fe0baf88c3df400f76
> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a2da79c8f872eec8229ce840e6b0146","RawContent":"[quote name=\"alwalters625\" post=\"1869110\" timestamp=\"1409076046\"]\nYeah, if you are having a longer wedding that makes sense, our ceremony is only going to be 15-20 minutes, then Depending on whether they start the cocktail hour immediately or if they delay it till six, I will probably take pictures in the free time and during part of the cocktail hour.  I would get married earlier, but I do not want our guests to have to come to the wedding, and then entertain themselves for a few hours before the cocktail hour\/dinner.[\/quote] \nThat was my dilemma too but after thinking it over agree with you...don&#039;t want people waiting around plus if it is a 5 o&#039;clock wedding with cocktails right after there should be some awesome sunset pics during that time. Will probably get some first look pics beforehand.","Attachments":[],"Id":1869238,"PostDate":1409081861,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>alwalters625, on 26 August 2014 - 02:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Yeah, if you are having a longer wedding that makes sense, our ceremony is only going to be 15-20 minutes, then Depending on whether they start the cocktail hour immediately or if they delay it till six, I will probably take pictures in the free time and during part of the cocktail hour.  I would get married earlier, but I do not want our guests to have to come to the wedding, and then entertain themselves for a few hours before the cocktail hour\/dinner.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n <br>\nThat was my dilemma too but after thinking it over agree with you...don't want people waiting around plus if it is a 5 o'clock wedding with cocktails right after there should be some awesome sunset pics during that time. Will probably get some first look pics beforehand.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandygray8.sg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407693970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Sandygray88","Id":279388,"Name":"Sandygray88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.254.151.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4df4f1837cede16368217d04007f9e3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Sandygray88\" post=\"1869238\" timestamp=\"1409096261\"]\nThat was my dilemma too but after thinking it over agree with you...don&#039;t want people waiting around plus if it is a 5 o&#039;clock wedding with cocktails right after there should be some awesome sunset pics during that time. Will probably get some first look pics beforehand.[\/quote]\nThat&#039;s what I&#039;m thinking as well, and we are also going to do a first look to get some pictures in then!  If I&#039;m timing it out correctly, I should be able to take pics for about an hour, and still attend part of the cocktail hour.  Although taking pics for an entire hour will possibly be you long for my FH, especially after the first look!","Attachments":[],"Id":1869244,"PostDate":1409082077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Sandygray88, on 26 August 2014 - 07:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>That was my dilemma too but after thinking it over agree with you...don't want people waiting around plus if it is a 5 o'clock wedding with cocktails right after there should be some awesome sunset pics during that time. Will probably get some first look pics beforehand.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat's what I'm thinking as well, and we are also going to do a first look to get some pictures in then!  If I'm timing it out correctly, I should be able to take pics for about an hour, and still attend part of the cocktail hour.  Although taking pics for an entire hour will possibly be you long for my FH, especially after the first look!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.159.214.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7653c9897992dd1818c42eb393f798e5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I can definitely understand that as well. I may have some kids at the wedding that are younger too.&amp;nbsp; i figured the parents would want to have a break, give them a nap etc. Ive been to a destination wedding before with a brreak between the ceremony and reception and it was good to grab a few drinks before. But again, personal preference! Both me and my FI hate being rushed so it works for us.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In the end its so hard to make these choices! A wedding at 4 would have been perfect for me but it wasnt an option :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869285,"PostDate":1409089168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I can definitely understand that as well. I may have some kids at the wedding that are younger too.\u00a0 i figured the parents would want to have a break, give them a nap etc. Ive been to a destination wedding before with a brreak between the ceremony and reception and it was good to grab a few drinks before. But again, personal preference! Both me and my FI hate being rushed so it works for us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In the end its so hard to make these choices! A wedding at 4 would have been perfect for me but it wasnt an option <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"906080576afe6314069d67a320a4ab4e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KAT2015\" post=\"1869285\" timestamp=\"1409103568\"]\nI can definitely understand that as well. I may have some kids at the wedding that are younger too.  i figured the parents would want to have a break, give them a nap etc. Ive been to a destination wedding before with a brreak between the ceremony and reception and it was good to grab a few drinks before. But again, personal preference! Both me and my FI hate being rushed so it works for us.\n \nIn the end its so hard to make these choices! A wedding at 4 would have been perfect for me but it wasnt an option :([\/quote]Yes with kids they would definitely want a break. Pic on tripadvisor of the plain set up of the beach ceremony. Really pretty! I&#039;m hoping to get the secrets beach gazebo as we have no kids going but after seeing that pic would be ok with that too. With the divine package I picked the saxaphonist....hope we get some song suggestions as I can&#039;t seem to find any songs that I know he can play...","Attachments":[],"Id":1869321,"PostDate":1409101552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KAT2015, on 26 August 2014 - 09:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I can definitely understand that as well. I may have some kids at the wedding that are younger too.\u00a0 i figured the parents would want to have a break, give them a nap etc. Ive been to a destination wedding before with a brreak between the ceremony and reception and it was good to grab a few drinks before. But again, personal preference! Both me and my FI hate being rushed so it works for us.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nIn the end its so hard to make these choices! A wedding at 4 would have been perfect for me but it wasnt an option <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYes with kids they would definitely want a break. Pic on tripadvisor of the plain set up of the beach ceremony. Really pretty! I'm hoping to get the secrets beach gazebo as we have no kids going but after seeing that pic would be ok with that too. With the divine package I picked the saxaphonist....hope we get some song suggestions as I can't seem to find any songs that I know he can play...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandygray8.sg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407693970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Sandygray88","Id":279388,"Name":"Sandygray88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"508ed4b3fe759037b8df455c449fd4a5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Sandygray88\" post=\"1869321\" timestamp=\"1409115952\"]\nYes with kids they would definitely want a break. Pic on tripadvisor of the plain set up of the beach ceremony. Really pretty! I&#039;m hoping to get the secrets beach gazebo as we have no kids going but after seeing that pic would be ok with that too. With the divine package I picked the saxaphonist....hope we get some song suggestions as I can&#039;t seem to find any songs that I know he can play...[\/quote]\nHi Sandy - I don&#039;t know if you know but a sound system is included in the ceremony.  So if you aren&#039;t 100% sold on the saxophonist, you can just tell them no thank you and bring your ipod down if there is something else you had in mind :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1869352,"PostDate":1409133098,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Sandygray88, on 27 August 2014 - 01:05 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Yes with kids they would definitely want a break. Pic on tripadvisor of the plain set up of the beach ceremony. Really pretty! I'm hoping to get the secrets beach gazebo as we have no kids going but after seeing that pic would be ok with that too. With the divine package I picked the saxaphonist....hope we get some song suggestions as I can't seem to find any songs that I know he can play...<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Sandy - I don't know if you know but a sound system is included in the ceremony. \u00a0So if you aren't 100% sold on the saxophonist, you can just tell them no thank you and bring your ipod down if there is something else you had in mind <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.254.151.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"443ce7e86182e4ec711066b090b5bb84","RawContent":"Ok, my wedding coordinator is Yeomandry Collado.  Does anyone else have her? Also how long does it take for them to send you the spreadsheet?","Attachments":[],"Id":1869429,"PostDate":1409168186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok, my wedding coordinator is Yeomandry Collado.  Does anyone else have her? Also how long does it take for them to send you the spreadsheet?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.159.214.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5633e984abee11bdfbce3df4ccb5a9f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"alwalters625\"] &amp;nbsp;I have her. &amp;nbsp;I got the spreadsheet pretty quick after booking. &amp;nbsp;But she takes 2-3 days to answer my emails. If you have the same package as me I could send it to you.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869434,"PostDate":1409170388,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279112-alwalters625\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">alwalters625<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I have her. \u00a0I got the spreadsheet pretty quick after booking. \u00a0But she takes 2-3 days to answer my emails. If you have the same package as me I could send it to you.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.254.151.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc7d08563da4bb32de9c53457e330888","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KAT2015\" post=\"1869434\" timestamp=\"1409184788\"]\n@[member=\"alwalters625\"]  I have her.  I got the spreadsheet pretty quick after booking.  But she takes 2-3 days to answer my emails. If you have the same package as me I could send it to you.[\/quote]\nI have the divine package? If that is what you have I would love to see it!  Let me know and I will message you my email!","Attachments":[],"Id":1869435,"PostDate":1409170638,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KAT2015, on 27 August 2014 - 08:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279112-alwalters625\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">alwalters625<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I have her. \u00a0I got the spreadsheet pretty quick after booking. \u00a0But she takes 2-3 days to answer my emails. If you have the same package as me I could send it to you.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI have the divine package? If that is what you have I would love to see it!  Let me know and I will message you my email!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.159.214.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0451122c72d5987524f178e29f0918cf","RawContent":"[quote name=\"alwalters625\" post=\"1869435\" timestamp=\"1409185038\"]\nI have the divine package? If that is what you have I would love to see it! Let me know and I will message you my email![\/quote] I can definitely email it.  I have Divine as well (it just makes it easier to read for you because it outlines what is included).\n\nI believe you fill it out and it actually generates the cost for you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1869436,"PostDate":1409170757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>alwalters625, on 27 August 2014 - 08:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have the divine package? If that is what you have I would love to see it! Let me know and I will message you my email!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0I can definitely email it. \u00a0I have Divine as well (it just makes it easier to read for you because it outlines what is included).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I believe you fill it out and it actually generates the cost for you.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.254.151.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc3dd1388bb9ed32491a89d9a4e9d07b","RawContent":"That sounds amazing!! Thank you I will send you my email address!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1869437,"PostDate":1409170874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That sounds amazing!! Thank you I will send you my email address!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":210,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
