{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e487490ec32856b1d586024e9f30ea34","RawContent":"I have her too...you should ask her to send you the spreadsheet as she will add things on it that you have agreed on...location , meals, flowers etc. I wonder if some things can be changed once you are there if you see something that another bride has done that you like better than something you have picked.","Attachments":[],"Id":1869439,"PostDate":1409173158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have her too...you should ask her to send you the spreadsheet as she will add things on it that you have agreed on...location , meals, flowers etc. I wonder if some things can be changed once you are there if you see something that another bride has done that you like better than something you have picked. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandygray8.sg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407693970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Sandygray88","Id":279388,"Name":"Sandygray88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.59.207.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8dd3d58c5849754e06b07bd9f3db8da","RawContent":"I&#039;m curious about changes as well, we want to do a buffet, but we have children coming.  Does anyone know if you can order kids meals even if you are doing a Buffett? Or maybe swap something out for a kid friendly item like hot dogs?","Attachments":[],"Id":1869447,"PostDate":1409175746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm curious about changes as well, we want to do a buffet, but we have children coming.  Does anyone know if you can order kids meals even if you are doing a Buffett? Or maybe swap something out for a kid friendly item like hot dogs?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"620f97591d478856184554f498eb5597","RawContent":"[quote name=\"alwalters625\" post=\"1869447\" timestamp=\"1409190146\"]\nI&#039;m curious about changes as well, we want to do a buffet, but we have children coming. Does anyone know if you can order kids meals even if you are doing a Buffett? Or maybe swap something out for a kid friendly item like hot dogs?[\/quote]\nI have no idea about this one - we&#039;re doing sit down!! I would think with a buffet the parents can find things for the kids that they will like since there are more options.  And you can share the menu with the parents so if the kid may not like ALL the food, they can feed them something from the snack bar before hand?","Attachments":[],"Id":1869536,"PostDate":1409225132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>alwalters625, on 27 August 2014 - 09:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm curious about changes as well, we want to do a buffet, but we have children coming. Does anyone know if you can order kids meals even if you are doing a Buffett? Or maybe swap something out for a kid friendly item like hot dogs?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have no idea about this one - we're doing sit down!! I would think with a buffet the parents can find things for the kids that they will like since there are more options. \u00a0And you can share the menu with the parents so if the kid may not like ALL the food, they can feed them something from the snack bar before hand?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.134.182.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ebe3d1b6b1fee3847af07eafbf6e215","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KAT2015\" post=\"1869536\" timestamp=\"1409239532\"]\nI have no idea about this one - we&#039;re doing sit down!! I would think with a buffet the parents can find things for the kids that they will like since there are more options.  And you can share the menu with the parents so if the kid may not like ALL the food, they can feed them something from the snack bar before hand?\n[\/quote]Yeah Hopefully we can do kids meals or the snack bar will probably be it.  My niece was adopted from the Congo, and for some reason she is extremely picky about the food she will eat.  That&#039;s my main concern!","Attachments":[],"Id":1869582,"PostDate":1409237516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KAT2015, on 28 August 2014 - 11:25 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I have no idea about this one - we're doing sit down!! I would think with a buffet the parents can find things for the kids that they will like since there are more options. \u00a0And you can share the menu with the parents so if the kid may not like ALL the food, they can feed them something from the snack bar before hand?<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYeah Hopefully we can do kids meals or the snack bar will probably be it.  My niece was adopted from the Congo, and for some reason she is extremely picky about the food she will eat.  That's my main concern!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1f520e4f6fd9fdc838681db22e7c173","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KAT2015\"] - I am sorry for the late reply!&amp;nbsp; I have not been on this site for a while!&amp;nbsp; My date is May 21st of 2015. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870044,"PostDate":1409590243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279198\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279198-kat2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KAT2015<\/span><\/a> - I am sorry for the late reply!\u00a0 I have not been on this site for a while!\u00a0 My date is May 21st of 2015. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7145df8ace8451952e9e559db640c65d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JYINGLI1\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married on May 21st of 2015, and I am very interested in sharing decorations!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870050,"PostDate":1409592776,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279519-jyingli1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JYINGLI1<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married on May 21st of 2015, and I am very interested in sharing decorations!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.159.214.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a71015dc4cffd728d852bf75b3772214","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Cwright\" post=\"1870044\" timestamp=\"1409604643\"]\n@[member=\"KAT2015\"] - I am sorry for the late reply!  I have not been on this site for a while!  My date is May 21st of 2015. :)[\/quote]\n@[member=\"Cwright\"]\n\nLooks like you&#039;ll be getting married the day after I arrive at the resort :)  Our travel dates (for guests) are May 20-27 with us staying until the 30th.  What dates are you there for?\n\nCongratulations!!!  We can definitely discuss sharing decorations - what are your colours\/plans?","Attachments":[],"Id":1870060,"PostDate":1409596125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cwright, on 01 September 2014 - 04:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279198\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279198-kat2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KAT2015<\/span><\/a> - I am sorry for the late reply!\u00a0 I have not been on this site for a while!\u00a0 My date is May 21st of 2015. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looks like you'll be getting married the day after I arrive at the resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Our travel dates (for guests) are May 20-27 with us staying until the 30th. \u00a0What dates are you there for?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations!!! \u00a0We can definitely discuss sharing decorations - what are your colours\/plans?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2584ef43842321245aad6df054c26d54","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KAT2015\" post=\"1870060\" timestamp=\"1409610525\"]\n\n\n\n\n@[member=\"Cwright\"]\n\nLooks like you&#039;ll be getting married the day after I arrive at the resort :)  Our travel dates (for guests) are May 20-27 with us staying until the 30th.  What dates are you there for?\n\nCongratulations!!!  We can definitely discuss sharing decorations - what are your colours\/plans?\n[\/quote]We are staying from the 16th to the 24th, but may alter the dates a little as we have not booked our plane tickets yet!  I have not done much with decorations yet.  I was thinking corals and oranges.  We are getting married at the fountain then having our reception at castaways. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1870074,"PostDate":1409602157,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KAT2015, on 01 September 2014 - 06:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275744\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275744-cwright\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cwright<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looks like you'll be getting married the day after I arrive at the resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Our travel dates (for guests) are May 20-27 with us staying until the 30th. \u00a0What dates are you there for?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations!!! \u00a0We can definitely discuss sharing decorations - what are your colours\/plans?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>We are staying from the 16th to the 24th, but may alter the dates a little as we have not booked our plane tickets yet!\u00a0 I have not done much with decorations yet.\u00a0 I was thinking corals and oranges.\u00a0 We are getting married at the fountain then having our reception at castaways. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388150678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1a7c8cadab2257b74ce6d710ff8b2c8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Cwright\" post=\"1870074\" timestamp=\"1409616557\"]\nWe are staying from the 16th to the 24th, but may alter the dates a little as we have not booked our plane tickets yet!  I have not done much with decorations yet.  I was thinking corals and oranges.  We are getting married at the fountain then having our reception at castaways. :)[\/quote]\nCoral seems to be a hot colour! We&#039;re doing coral, teal and mint with gold accent (I believe!).\n\nThe more I look online, the more I simplify my decor.  I&#039;m thinking 2-3 pillar candles in the middle, surrounded by some sort of wood wreath (or dark brown twine) with fake flowers in our colours.  Then maybe little shells on the table and candle favours for each guest (lit so they are part of the decor).\n\nI&#039;m thinking now I won&#039;t do any chair sashes at all.\n\nYour wedding plans sound dreamy!!! I would have loved the fountain but didn&#039;t want to tie ourselves into the $1500 charge for the extra decor - without the plank I&#039;m not sure how it would go and I wasn&#039;t risking it.  Castaways would have been amazing, but the $3000 isn&#039;t in our budget for it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1870181,"PostDate":1409655598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cwright, on 01 September 2014 - 08:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are staying from the 16th to the 24th, but may alter the dates a little as we have not booked our plane tickets yet!\u00a0 I have not done much with decorations yet.\u00a0 I was thinking corals and oranges.\u00a0 We are getting married at the fountain then having our reception at castaways. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Coral seems to be a hot colour! We're doing coral, teal and mint with gold accent (I believe!).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The more I look online, the more I simplify my decor. \u00a0I'm thinking 2-3 pillar candles in the middle, surrounded by some sort of wood wreath (or dark brown twine) with fake flowers in our colours. \u00a0Then maybe little shells on the table and candle favours for each guest (lit so they are part of the decor).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm thinking now I won't do any chair sashes at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your wedding plans sound dreamy!!! I would have loved the fountain but didn't want to tie ourselves into the $1500 charge for the extra decor - without the plank I'm not sure how it would go and I wasn't risking it. \u00a0Castaways would have been amazing, but the $3000 isn't in our budget for it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83bf93fc6f1946865f0853c87b997c8d","RawContent":"Some of the pics without the chair sashes look great so I&#039;m starting to think no chair sashes also. I probably am going to splurge on some flowers though...was going to do a dyi for the bridesmaids bouquets but the fresh tropical flower ones look so great. Is anyone else getting the divine package? Are you adding a photographer ?","Attachments":[],"Id":1870458,"PostDate":1409772464,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Some of the pics without the chair sashes look great so I'm starting to think no chair sashes also. I probably am going to splurge on some flowers though...was going to do a dyi for the bridesmaids bouquets but the fresh tropical flower ones look so great. Is anyone else getting the divine package? Are you adding a photographer ? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandygray8.sg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.230.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407693970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Sandygray88","Id":279388,"Name":"Sandygray88","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":210,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
