{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":669,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1894495,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282874,"Name":"km0711","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1430096484,"LastPoster":{"Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":35,"Preview":{"Id":1894495,"PostDate":1430096484,"PostContent":"I am trying to plan a wedding for September 2016. All I know is that we want a beach ceremony at...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"km0711@msn.com","IpAddress":"23.117.3.0","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430096222,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"km0711","Id":282874,"Name":"km0711","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.117.3.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79120,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"497390ef485318427688da36b0275488","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am trying to plan a wedding for September 2016. All I know is that we want a beach ceremony at sunset. Hubby to be is a FL native so I want to start here. What are good inexpensive places for a beach wedding and a reception for 25-50 people? Key word is inexpensive....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894495,"PostDate":1430096484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am trying to plan a wedding for September 2016. All I know is that we want a beach ceremony at sunset. Hubby to be is a FL native so I want to start here. What are good inexpensive places for a beach wedding and a reception for 25-50 people? Key word is inexpensive....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"km0711@msn.com","IpAddress":"23.117.3.0","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430096222,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"km0711","Id":282874,"Name":"km0711","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.208.23.211","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79120,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d630095d97838e1047ec82f2d9afa77c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi km0711! &amp;nbsp;Congratulations on your engagement and upcoming Florida wedding! &amp;nbsp;Not sure what your budget is but our wedding venue in Key West is perfect for that amount of people! &amp;nbsp;Our website is www.oldtownmanorweddings.com and you can view packages and get an idea of pricing here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.oldtownmanorweddings.com\/key-west-wedding-packages.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.oldtownmanorweddings.com\/key-west-wedding-packages.html&lt;\/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;Please contact Nicole at nicole@oldtownmanorweddings.com or (305) 292-2121 if you would like any additional information. &amp;nbsp;Best of luck and once again, congratulations! :) &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sunny regards,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Nicole&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894533,"PostDate":1430139880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi km0711! \u00a0Congratulations on your engagement and upcoming Florida wedding! \u00a0Not sure what your budget is but our wedding venue in Key West is perfect for that amount of people! \u00a0Our website is www.oldtownmanorweddings.com and you can view packages and get an idea of pricing here:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.oldtownmanorweddings.com\/key-west-wedding-packages.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.oldtownma...g-packages.html<\/a>. \u00a0Please contact Nicole at nicole@oldtownmanorweddings.com or (305) 292-2121 if you would like any additional information. \u00a0Best of luck and once again, congratulations! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sunny regards,<\/p>\n<p>Nicole<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@oldtownmanorweddings.com","IpAddress":"68.208.23.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421776893,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"oldtownmanorweddings","Id":281805,"Name":"oldtownmanorweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.196.44.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79120,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ff2ab4dead1038026a3a6637ac8347f","RawContent":"Congrats KM0711!  We originally wanted to get married in Hollywood, Florida and found it difficult to stay under $15,000 for everything.  The least expensive beach option we found was John U Lloyd state park.  You would need to pay a small fee for a beach permit and ranger but can control your food and alcohol costs since there are no preferred vendors.  I saw pics of an evening reception under a clear tent and it was gorgeous!  \n\n\nGood luck!\n\nSandra","Attachments":[],"Id":1894571,"PostDate":1430157226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats KM0711!  We originally wanted to get married in Hollywood, Florida and found it difficult to stay under $15,000 for everything.  The least expensive beach option we found was John U Lloyd state park.  You would need to pay a small fee for a beach permit and ranger but can control your food and alcohol costs since there are no preferred vendors.  I saw pics of an evening reception under a clear tent and it was gorgeous!  <br><br>\nGood luck!<br>\nSandra\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421707270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79120,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25ff372333dc018924ca0179a06098b7","RawContent":"We found it very difficult to stay inexpensive in Florida (where we are both natives of) mostly because our guests would have to arrive in Mia and then rent a car and drive to the Keys. Florida is expensive anytime except for snowbird season. BUT a good friend is marrying at Sheraton suites key west and they have 40 guests and are very very happy with their budget. I dont know what it is but i know it was similar to what we had in mind. Also Don Paella (serves all S Fl) catered our engagement party which was 85 people for less than $1K and food was phenomenal. I dont know much about N Florida though. I heard Jupiter Lighthoiuse is very reasonable and very pretty\nI meant inexpensive except during Hurricane season, not snowbird season.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896078,"PostDate":1431480064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We found it very difficult to stay inexpensive in Florida (where we are both natives of) mostly because our guests would have to arrive in Mia and then rent a car and drive to the Keys. Florida is expensive anytime except for snowbird season. BUT a good friend is marrying at Sheraton suites key west and they have 40 guests and are very very happy with their budget. I dont know what it is but i know it was similar to what we had in mind. Also Don Paella (serves all S Fl) catered our engagement party which was 85 people for less than $1K and food was phenomenal. I dont know much about N Florida though. I heard Jupiter Lighthoiuse is very reasonable and very pretty<br \/>I meant inexpensive except during Hurricane season, not snowbird season. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keredondo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403646019,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecomingaRiggio","Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79120","Title":"Location Needed. Help!","LastPostDate":1431480064},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
