f;\">Riu Palace<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Royalton Resorts<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Secrets Resorts<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Valentin Imperial Maya<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Zoetry Resorts<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">\u2026and more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:9pt\">Terms and Conditions:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong>\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:9pt\">Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY.\u00a0 Offer not\u00a0combine-able\u00a0with \"Bride & Groom Fly Free Promo\". A minimum of 10 paid rooms with a minimum of 3\u00a0nights per room (or a total of 30 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.\u00a0 Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.\u00a0\u00a0Bride and Groom must book resort and trip insurance through Wright Travel\/Travel Impressions.\u00a0 Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel.\u00a0 Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.\u00a0 Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.\u00a0 Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/med_gallery_206696_17612_57816.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_206696_17612_57816.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\