 for advice on planning a wedding in St Thomas. I am currently looking at the Marriott Frenchman&#039;s Reef Resort. But I am going to have a small group and therefore do not need a grand reception. I would prefer a&amp;nbsp;nice restuarant that could give us a section and maybe&amp;nbsp;plan a group activity for everyone, such as a tour of the island or&amp;nbsp;sunset cruise.&amp;nbsp;Any tips and advice would be greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850125,"PostDate":1399991972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am looking for advice on planning a wedding in St Thomas. I am currently looking at the Marriott Frenchman's Reef Resort. But I am going to have a small group and therefore do not need a grand reception. I would prefer a\u00a0nice restuarant that could give us a section and maybe\u00a0plan a group activity for everyone, such as a tour of the island or\u00a0sunset cruise.\u00a0Any tips and advice would be greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"futuremrsreece2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.6.147.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399908488,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"futuremrsreece2015","Id":277935,"Name":"futuremrsreece2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.64.83.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77049,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79e9d417054e7b86d617994d8f6f99f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to BDW! You will definitely find information here that should help you out! There is truly a wealth of it, and everyone is more than willing to share what they&#039;ve learned!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850187,"PostDate":1400009992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome to BDW! You will definitely find information here that should help you out! There is truly a wealth of it, and everyone is more than willing to share what they've learned!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"77049","Title":"St Thomas Wedding?","LastPostDate":1400009992},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"not