am new to the site and looking to marry next August.&amp;nbsp; Now, here is my dilemma.&amp;nbsp; I want a Catholic wedding but have very limited options.&amp;nbsp; I also have one huge family that surpasses the minimum of 20\/40 people for each package I have found.&amp;nbsp; I also want a private reception (the longer it runs the better, 3 hours minimum.)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have narrowed it down to the following three resorts:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dreams Tulum \u2013 worry is price per added person, hefty tag&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Palladium \u2013 have never been to any of their resorts\/would be going in blind.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Riu Palace Mexico \u2013 Love the Riu chain and but not sure about the chapel&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone can give me any feedback on any of the three I would be most appreciative.&amp;nbsp; I am just trying to have my guests enjoy a great resort abd a beautiful catholic wedding at the same time. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903431,"PostDate":1440585868,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am new to the site and looking to marry next August.\u00a0 Now, here is my dilemma.\u00a0 I want a Catholic wedding but have very limited options.\u00a0 I also have one huge family that surpasses the minimum of 20\/40 people for each package I have found.\u00a0 I also want a private reception (the longer it runs the better, 3 hours minimum.)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have narrowed it down to the following three resorts:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Dreams Tulum \u2013 worry is price per added person, hefty tag<\/p>\n<p>Grand Palladium \u2013 have never been to any of their resorts\/would be going in blind.<\/p>\n<p>Riu Palace Mexico \u2013 Love the Riu chain and but not sure about the chapel<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone can give me any feedback on any of the three I would be most appreciative.\u00a0 I am just trying to have my guests enjoy a great resort abd a beautiful catholic wedding at the same time. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you in advance!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mirnitap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.55.144.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440527021,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mirnitap","Id":284571,"Name":"Mirnitap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79533,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b9d79d4fe0af1c8ca0a17bf725dcb38","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Mirnitap,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TA Wendy here.. Of the 3 resorts you have mentioned.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dreams likely WOULD be the highest in price but is very nice and I love their chapel.. very Mexican\/ Spanish feel, really atmospheric and cute. Very nice resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Palladium is a huge complex.. lower prices, and I have worked with many couples who chose this resort and never had a complaint about it.. but it is very big. think golf carts to get you from one side to the other. The chapel there is pretty and large.. more traditional looking, not especially Mexican in feel, but very pretty when decorated with flowers and such.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;RIU Palace Mexico - This resort is in the Playacar area.. near to 5th Ave in Playa Del Carmen and lots of fun in the area.. it would price out in the middle between the other two most likely. Their chapel is small, or there is a very cute Catholic chapel right at the end of 5th Ave that I have had couples use.. very sweet chapel and makes for a fun little walk down 5th Ave with your guests and everyone sort of trailing behind and cheering.. If you were to use this I recommend hiring mariachis to walk with you as you exit.. very fun!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There is also a GREAT and very unique chapel at Ixcaret park .. it is sort of underground and exceedingly beautiful. Occidental Grand Ixcaret hotel is right there and very much on the lower end price wise.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope that is helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903435,"PostDate":1440586988,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Mirnitap,<\/p>\n<p>TA Wendy here.. Of the 3 resorts you have mentioned.<\/p>\n<p>Dreams likely WOULD be the highest in price but is very nice and I love their chapel.. very Mexican\/ Spanish feel, really atmospheric and cute. Very nice resort.<\/p>\n<p>Grand Palladium is a huge complex.. lower prices, and I have worked with many couples who chose this resort and never had a complaint about it.. but it is very big. think golf carts to get you from one side to the other. The chapel there is pretty and large.. more traditional looking, not especially Mexican in feel, but very pretty when decorated with flowers and such.<\/p>\n<p>RIU Palace Mexico - This resort is in the Playacar area.. near to 5th Ave in Playa Del Carmen and lots of fun in the area.. it would price out in the middle between the other two most likely. Their chapel is small, or there is a very cute Catholic chapel right at the end of 5th Ave that I have had couples use.. very sweet chapel and makes for a fun little walk down 5th Ave with your guests and everyone sort of trailing behind and cheering.. If you were to use this I recommend hiring mariachis to walk with you as you exit.. very fun!<\/p>\n<p>There is also a GREAT and very unique chapel at Ixcaret park .. it is sort of underground and exceedingly beautiful. Occidental Grand Ixcaret hotel is right there and very much on the lower end price wise.<\/p>\n<p>I hope that is helpful!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238016240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.50.229.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79533,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3063b17e99cc25c13f980c0f2806f55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@TA Wendy, thank you so much! &amp;nbsp;This definitely helps narrow down my decision. &amp;nbsp;I am leaning toward the Riu due to their ability to accommodate my large group. &amp;nbsp;The Dreams Tulum is a dream but only if I had a smaller guest count.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A million thanks once again!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mirna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903446,"PostDate":1440592341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@TA Wendy, thank you so much! \u00a0This definitely helps narrow down my decision. \u00a0I am leaning toward the Riu due to their ability to accommodate my large group. \u00a0The Dreams Tulum is a dream but only if I had a smaller guest count.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A million thanks once again!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Mirna<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mirnitap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.55.144.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440527021,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mirnitap","Id":284571,"Name":"Mirnitap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79533,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2cfe750e3c45e0766193b423a77a7372","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mirnitap\"] &amp;nbsp;Congrats and welcome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All I can do is second what @TAWendy said because you can guarantee she knows her stuff!! You likely won&#039;t get a better straight up answer than what she gave you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you want to try and get details about the 3 resorts in terms of what they offer, you could contact Wright Travel directly through this site and TA Wendy, and you could also type into the search bar at the top and read the tons of threads that will come up. There are just too many to add here. Reading is the best way to go through the site because I can almost guarantee that whatever questions you have, another bride has asked the same questions at some point in time so the answers are likely here if you read through.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903447,"PostDate":1440592450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284571\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284571-mirnitap\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mirnitap<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Congrats and welcome!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All I can do is second what @TAWendy said because you can guarantee she knows her stuff!! You likely won't get a better straight up answer than what she gave you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want to try and get details about the 3 resorts in terms of what they offer, you could contact Wright Travel directly through this site and TA Wendy, and you could also type into the search bar at the top and read the tons of threads that will come up. There are just too many to add here. Reading is the best way to go through the site because I can almost guarantee that whatever questions you have, another bride has asked the same questions at some point in time so the answers are likely here if you read through.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79533,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Today, 03:37 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1440689860,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b318df709291aa2c7354e583483695f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats Mirna and welcome to our forum community!!! with all the resources here, you&#039;ll find lots of great advice, suggestions and ideas to help with your wedding plans.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To show you what your wedding could look like at the choices you&#039;ve listed, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one........enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153477913829487.1073741942.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt; Dreams Tulum Wedding Album 1: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11063583_10153477926409487_384162674837439147_o.jpg\" alt=\"11063583_10153477926409487_3841626748374\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151321452604487.491905.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Dreams Tulum Wedding Album 2 :&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/299519_10151321461439487_993957116_n.jpg?oh=6b978bced939c3e351814e4363dba3d2&amp;amp;oe=566C9A68\" alt=\"299519_10151321461439487_993957116_n.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153293696454487.1073741929.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Colonial Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11127871_10153293698339487_5790667232075866195_o.jpg\" alt=\"11127871_10153293698339487_5790667232075\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144793740_o.jpg\" alt=\"11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There&#039;s also a lovely chapel for a Catholic wedding at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152443957034487.1073741893.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;The Royal Playa del Carmen&lt;\/a&gt;....as shown here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10380178_10152443960314487_1654169976908148968_o.jpg\" alt=\"10380178_10152443960314487_1654169976908\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10333400_10152443963689487_4142329497186284199_o.jpg\" alt=\"10333400_10152443963689487_4142329497186\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find the perfect place for your Special Day - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903585,"PostDate":1440689653,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats Mirna and welcome to our forum community!!! with all the resources here, you'll find lots of great advice, suggestions and ideas to help with your wedding plans.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To show you what your wedding could look like at the choices you've listed, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one........enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153477913829487.1073741942.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'> Dreams Tulum Wedding Album 1: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11063583_10153477926409487_384162674837439147_o.jpg\" alt=\"11063583_10153477926409487_3841626748374\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151321452604487.491905.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Tulum Wedding Album 2 :<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/299519_10151321461439487_993957116_n.jpg?oh=6b978bced939c3e351814e4363dba3d2&oe=566C9A68\" alt=\"299519_10151321461439487_993957116_n.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153293696454487.1073741929.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Colonial Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11127871_10153293698339487_5790667232075866195_o.jpg\" alt=\"11127871_10153293698339487_5790667232075\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144793740_o.jpg\" alt=\"11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There's also a lovely chapel for a Catholic wedding at <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152443957034487.1073741893.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The Royal Playa del Carmen<\/a>....as shown here:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10380178_10152443960314487_1654169976908148968_o.jpg\" alt=\"10380178_10152443960314487_1654169976908\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10333400_10152443963689487_4142329497186284199_o.jpg\" alt=\"10333400_10152443963689487_4142329497186\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the perfect place for your Special Day - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79533","Title":"Catholic Wedding Help & Advice","LastPostDate":1440689653},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
