> User lorishultz2016 (284536)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":27,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1903550,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284587,"Name":"hswerdy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1440679409,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1903550,"PostDate":1440679409,"PostContent":"I just got engaged to the man I love after dating 5 years and shooting for a June 2016 wedding!\u00a0I...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_swerdlik@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"152.131.10.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440678408,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hswerdy","Id":284587,"Name":"hswerdy","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.131.10.2","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79540,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4037db605f5d0202ac50d5c0c80b83f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just got engaged to the man I love after dating 5 years and shooting for a June 2016 wedding!&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m finding the wedding planning process to be a&amp;nbsp;bit stressful! I guess I was expecting something different. lol...&amp;nbsp;All of the decisions...I am just completely overwhelmed. I don&#039;t even know where to start...Does anyone have any good advice? We really want to keep it simple and small...like 20 people, destination wedding.&amp;nbsp; We&amp;nbsp;were finding&amp;nbsp;all the venues near us have minimums that we will not be able to reach with such a small party. There are so many choices--trying to take into account budget for guests to attend, including his 3 kids (family friendly) in the wedding, and his side of the family is LDS and mine isn&#039;t...which mostly just effects alcohol...I don&#039;t want to offend anyone but at the same time I definitely want to have a few drinks! lol. I feel like I am back to square one after contacting many venues near me and finding that our wedding is just too small which is why a destination would be perfect for us. I have tried looking for wedding checklists anything too helpful yet.&amp;nbsp;I would appreciate any advice . Thanks all!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903550,"PostDate":1440679409,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just got engaged to the man I love after dating 5 years and shooting for a June 2016 wedding!\u00a0I'm finding the wedding planning process to be a\u00a0bit stressful! I guess I was expecting something different. lol...\u00a0All of the decisions...I am just completely overwhelmed. I don't even know where to start...Does anyone have any good advice? We really want to keep it simple and small...like 20 people, destination wedding.\u00a0 We\u00a0were finding\u00a0all the venues near us have minimums that we will not be able to reach with such a small party. There are so many choices--trying to take into account budget for guests to attend, including his 3 kids (family friendly) in the wedding, and his side of the family is LDS and mine isn't...which mostly just effects alcohol...I don't want to offend anyone but at the same time I definitely want to have a few drinks! lol. I feel like I am back to square one after contacting many venues near me and finding that our wedding is just too small which is why a destination would be perfect for us. I have tried looking for wedding checklists anything too helpful yet.\u00a0I would appreciate any advice . Thanks all!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_swerdlik@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"152.131.10.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440678408,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hswerdy","Id":284587,"Name":"hswerdy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79540,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Today, 03:22 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1440688947,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b109c45ebc2655b75e3e7e117f9376e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community hswerdy and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of info, advice, suggestions and support from everyone here, so well done on getting off to a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you best of luck in finding the answers you&#039;re looking for and creating the most wonderful wedding day celebration - Ever!!! cheers, team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10014050_10152285892509487_156542042_o.jpg\" alt=\"10014050_10152285892509487_156542042_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....oh yes and ......no, wedding planning doesn&#039;t suck - it&#039;s EXCITING!!! and so FUN :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903578,"PostDate":1440688896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community hswerdy and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you've come to the right place for lots of info, advice, suggestions and support from everyone here, so well done on getting off to a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you best of luck in finding the answers you're looking for and creating the most wonderful wedding day celebration - Ever!!! cheers, team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10014050_10152285892509487_156542042_o.jpg\" alt=\"10014050_10152285892509487_156542042_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....oh yes and ......no, wedding planning doesn't suck - it's EXCITING!!! and so FUN <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79540","Title":"Tell Me Wedding Planning Doesn't Suck....","LastPostDate":1440688896},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
