'color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238016240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79532,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e42678090b1820e39dd1d4d570590dd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are several Azul Fives brides to be here at the moment and one just newly married so you&#039;ve come to the right place for information. I would recommend doing a search in the search bar at the top for Azul Fives and reading through the threads. There are too many to attach here but the reading will keep you busy for a while. You&#039;ll get a ton of ideas and suggestions as well as all the advice the ladies have shared.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903383,"PostDate":1440536346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are several Azul Fives brides to be here at the moment and one just newly married so you've come to the right place for information. I would recommend doing a search in the search bar at the top for Azul Fives and reading through the threads. There are too many to attach here but the reading will keep you busy for a while. You'll get a ton of ideas and suggestions as well as all the advice the ladies have shared.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79532,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0558d4196ed9a9735d6520860c251524","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome Lisa!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have come to the right place - you will \"meet\" lots of great brides here and find lots of information!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Like @[member=\"acw271011\"] said....trying searching for topics in the search bar.&amp;nbsp; Anything you can think of, there&#039;s a good chance more than one bride has already had the same question!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of luck with your planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903422,"PostDate":1440577059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome Lisa!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have come to the right place - you will \"meet\" lots of great brides here and find lots of information!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Like @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> said....trying searching for topics in the search bar.\u00a0 Anything you can think of, there's a good chance more than one bride has already had the same question!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of luck with your planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411105603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79532,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"114983cadf694386b73a7f32c567fb53","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! The Riviera Maya is my happy place :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have come to the right place -- BDW is full of incredible insight, advice and information from current and past brides as well as wonderful vendors!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903465,"PostDate":1440599548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! The Riviera Maya is my happy place <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have come to the right place -- BDW is full of incredible insight, advice and information from current and past brides as well as wonderful vendors!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285936345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79532,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5eb622095a98367d5ce1c19fdaae8e02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey LisaBear - Congrats + welcome!!! Our Playa del Carmen area is so beautiful, you&#039;re sure to have the wedding of your dreams here :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research + planning - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.jpg\" alt=\"10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903575,"PostDate":1440688599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey LisaBear - Congrats + welcome!!! Our Playa del Carmen area is so beautiful, you're sure to have the wedding of your dreams here <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research + planning - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.jpg\" alt=\"10012197_10152285889364487_524506458_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79532","Title":"New Bride","LastPostDate":1440688599},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]